{"change_summary":"No additional source edits were required in this apply-fixes pass. The latest review approved the shrimp scenario deliverable with no follow-up amendments, so this stage consisted of confirming that the shrimp probe and tracing files remain unchanged in the worktree and re-running the targeted validation that demonstrates the approved state is still green, including persisted summary trace artifacts.","outstanding_risks":["The worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing modifications in `.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_carbonate_probes.rs`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs`, and untracked `.ralph-burning/`; they were left untouched.","The thermal-suppression probe still depends on seeded berried females plus a first-day 25->31 C heat shock, so substantial future retunes to hatch timing or thermal egg-drop behavior may require fixture adjustment.","Successful shrimp-summary traces are still written to deterministic `/tmp/tank_harness/.../trace.jsonl` paths, so rerunning the same seeded summary probe overwrites the prior success artifact bundle for that scenario label.","A separate pre-existing VS-07 denitrification failure in `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs` remains outside this shrimp deliverable's scope."],"steps":[{"description":"Review the latest approved validation outcome and inspect the workspace for any remaining actionable follow-up on the shrimp scenario deliverable.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Confirm that the shrimp probe and tracing files already contain the approved implementation, so no new source patch is required in this pass.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Re-run the shrimp scenario and tracing validation to verify the approved state remains green and the summary traces are still emitted to deterministic artifact paths.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git diff -- crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes.rs crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` returned no output, confirming no new edits were needed in the shrimp probe or tracing implementation for this pass.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes -- --nocapture` passed; all 6 tests succeeded, and the summary runner again reported all 5 shrimp probes as PASS with breeding `initial=10, final=260, cycles=10` and thermal suppression `cool_hatches=9, warm_hatches=0, warm_egg_drops=1`.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test tracing -- --nocapture` passed; all 23 tracing tests succeeded, including `trace_verbosity_reports_tick_snapshot_for_shrimp_probe_debugging`.","`rg --files /tmp/tank_harness | rg 'summary_seed660[0-4]/trace\\.jsonl$'` returned 8 persisted summary trace artifacts, covering breeding, both thermal arms, chemistry stress, all three chloride-protection branches, and crash mode.","`git status --short` after validation still showed only unrelated pre-existing modifications in `.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_carbonate_probes.rs`, `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs`, and untracked `.ralph-burning/`; the shrimp probe and tracing files remained clean."]}